--- !u!114 &1217585147
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1217585141}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 69b7c2ea49c56774ab84d35a64bd3677, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MayorCharacter
  maxHealth: 100
  maxStamina: 100
  maxMana: 100
  staminaRegenRate: 20
  manaRegenRate: 10
  staminaRegenDelay: 1
  manaRegenDelay: 2
  weaponSlotTransform: {fileID: 0}
  lowHealthEffects: {fileID: 0}
  SpeakImagePrefab: {fileID: 5010717163584122740, guid: 5435685a6e1c9a34d9185f2794b50ad8, type: 3}
  FadeUI: {fileID: 1604713092}
  cutsceneCamera:
  - {fileID: 0}
  cutsceneLine: 
  endCutsceneLine: 0
  DialogueBox: {fileID: 1604713094}
  textComponent: {fileID: 1604713093}
  lines:
  - Hey you, you're finally awake. Listen here, criminal scum.
  - I don't like you, nor do I trust you... but we're desperate.
  - I know you haven't really seen the effects of what your former <b><color=#541834>Shadow
    Gang</color></b> has done, being in here and all...
  - But without the elements, the fine people of my town are facing great hardship.
  - Without <b><color=#ff3300>flames</color></b>, our nights are dark and unprotected.
  - The townsfolk must travel far just to get a drink of <b><color=#0073bf>water</color></b>.
  - We're lucky that we at least have our <b><color=#1c8c20>Great Tree</color></b>
    to give us food and shelter, but we're surrounded by desert.
  - We need the elements back, and you're our best hope.
  - I can't believe I'm doing this but... If you reclaim the elements, I shall use
    my Mayoral powers to waive your crimes against us.
  - Take this sword and head to the <b><color=#ff3300>Dungeon of Flames</color></b>
    to the north, you can start your journey there.
  - Good luck, Crim- ...<b><color=#8134ad>Maguso</color></b>.
  hasSecondaryLines: 1
  secondaryLines:
  - What are you waiting around for? Go save my town and earn your darn freedom!
  - Ahem... ...Please.
  textSpeed: 0.05
  happyIndex: 6
  angryIndex: 3
  secondaryHappyIndex: -1
  secondaryAngryIndex: 0
